## What This Document Does Not Cover
- **AAA violations and missing assertions** — the anti-pattern section of each
language guide covers these in language-specific syntax; they are not repeated here.
- **Coverage gates** — the diff-coverage section of each file under `langs/` and
`scripts/test_gates.js`.
- **Completion judgment** — the `verify` skill. "Tests pass" and "the requirement
is satisfied" are different questions.
